OL,3,GNEWSA'Summer rail problems have cost me
OL,4,Amore than #800'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA train passenger said problems on the
OL,7,Frailway line between King's Lynn and
OL,8,FCambridge over the summer had cost him
OL,9,F#800.
OL,11,FData from a passenger group showed 280
OL,12,Ftrains were cancelled on the Fen Line
OL,13,Fin August, 380 in July and 177 in June.
OL,14,FOperator Great Northern said hot, dry
OL,15,Fweather had damaged tracks and caused
OL,16,Fair conditioning to fail.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
