OL,3,GNEWSA'Summer rail problems have cost me
OL,4,Amore than #800'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarry Cheeseman regularly travels
OL,7,Fbetween his homes in Norfolk and
OL,8,FLondon, and contacted BBC Your Voice to
OL,9,Fexplain how he had devised "escape
OL,10,Fplans" to cope with problems at any
OL,11,Fpoint in a journey.
OL,13,FHe said those plans had meant spending
OL,14,Fextra money on parking, fuel and taxis
OL,15,Fon several occasions.
